{
  "Npcs.Zetaz.Desc": "Zetaz has gone from a pipsqueak to the biggest imp you've seen! Though he has the familiar red skin, curving pointed horns, and wings you would expect to find on an imp, his feet now end in hooves, and his body is covered with thick layers of muscle. He still wears the trademark imp loincloth, though it bulges and shifts with his movements in a way that suggests considerable size. His shoulders are wrapped with studded leather and his wrists are covered with metallic bracers."
  "Npcs.Zetaz.Name": "Zetaz"
}
